<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<!--
	Download of the export of a project as an ETS project archive (.knxproj). "file" carries the
	result of <export-knxproj> (de.haumacher.ehome.exporter.ExportKnxprojAction): the archive named
	after the project, offered by a read-only binary input as a download link.

	The archive is not signed (the signature files of a .knxproj can only be created by an installed
	ETS), so ETS refuses it; E-Home and other tools reading the project schema read it. See
	doc/knx/export.md.
-->
<view>
	<channels>
		<channel name="file"/>
	</channels>
	<window width="600px">
		<title>
			<en>Export as .knxproj</en>
			<de>Als .knxproj exportieren</de>
		</title>
		<inset>
			<stack gap="loose">
				<text>
					<label>
						<en>The project has been exported in the ETS project format (schema 11, ETS 4) with the master data, catalogs, hardware and application programs it uses. The file is not signed: ETS does not import it, E-Home and other tools reading the ETS format do.</en>
						<de>Das Projekt wurde im ETS-Projektformat (Schema 11, ETS 4) exportiert, mit den Stammdaten, Katalogen, Hardware-Beschreibungen und Applikationsprogrammen, die es verwendet. Die Datei ist nicht signiert: Die ETS importiert sie nicht, E-Home und andere Werkzeuge, die das ETS-Format lesen, schon.</de>
					</label>
				</text>
				<fields>
					<value-input
						readonly="true"
						type="tl.core:Binary"
						value="file"
					>
						<label>
							<en>File</en>
							<de>Datei</de>
						</label>
						<!-- A value input picks no control by the type tl.core:Binary (TL #29809, doc/tl-todo.md); the binary field offers the download. -->
						<input-control class="com.top_logic.layout.view.form.BinaryControlProvider"/>
					</value-input>
				</fields>
			</stack>
		</inset>
		<actions>
			<button>
				<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.CancelDialogCommand">
					<label>
						<en>Close</en>
						<de>Schließen</de>
					</label>
				</action>
			</button>
		</actions>
	</window>
</view>
